      "clause_b": "bgb_507",
      "description": "Potential conflict regarding the scope of pre-contractual information: bgb_506 invokes general rules, while bgb_507(3) explicitly derogates from bgb_491a, creating a risk of 'double-regulation' or 'regulatory gap' depending on interpretation of the 'Teilzahlungsgeschäft' definition."
    },
    {
