    },
    {
      "clause_a": "bgb_514",
      "clause_b": "bgb_491",
      "description": "Circular reference and scope ambiguity: §514 applies §497/§498 to unentgeltliche Darlehen, but §491 defines consumer loans as entgeltlich, creating a classification deadlock."
